PROJECT Social

DATABASE SQLITE

AUTH JWT

USE auth.roles
USE auth.password_reset
USE auth.oauth.google
USE auth.oauth.github

MODEL User
    name STRING
    bio TEXT OPTIONAL

MODEL Post
    title STRING

RELATION User HAS_MANY Post

VALIDATE email REQUIRED EMAIL
VALIDATE password REQUIRED MIN 8

ROUTE GET /posts
ROUTE POST /posts
ROUTE DELETE /posts/{id} ROLE admin
